<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian Smithkline Beecham profit lower.</title>
<headline>Nigerian Smithkline Beecham profit lower.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year result to end-December 1996.</p>
<p>(In million naira unless stated)</p>
<p>					  1997	1996</p>
<p> Turnover .......2,927 vs 2,632</p>
<p> Profit before taxation	   390.8 vs 451.5</p>
<p> Taxation			     146.2 vs 141.7</p>
<p> Profit after taxation	    244.6 vs 309.7</p>
<p> Dividend per share	     25 kobo vs 12.9 kobo</p>
<p>Payment on September 12, 1997 ($1=83.20 naira)</p>
<p>--Lagos newsroom +234 1 2630317</p>
